<title>UK: TENNIS-WIMBLEDON MEN'S SINGLES RESULTS-DAY ONE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WIMBLEDON MEN'S SINGLES RESULTS-DAY ONE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round men's singles results</p>
<p>at the Wimbledon tennis championships on Monday (prefix denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>Juan Albert Viloca (Spain) beat Marc Goellner (Germany) 7-5</p>
<p>4-6 7-6 (7-5) 7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>Javier Frana (Argentina) beat Martin Damm (Czech Republic) 6-7</p>
<p>(5-7) 6-4 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>10-Carlos Moya (Spain) beat Steve Bryan (U.S.) 7-6 (7-1) 6-3 4-6</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>14-Tim Henman (Britain) beat Daniel Nestor (Canada)  7-6</p>
<p>(13-11) 6-1 6-4</p>
<p>4-Richard Krajicek (Netherlands) beat Marcello Craca</p>
<p>(Germany) 7-6 (7-5) 6-2 6-4</p>
<p>2-Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) beat Dinu Pescariu (Romania) 6-1</p>
<p>6-3 6-3</p>
<p>Andrew Richardson (Britain) beat Sergi Duran (Spain) 7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>6-3 6-3</p>
<p>Brett Steven (New Zealand) beat Lionel Roux (France) 6-2 6-2</p>
<p>7-6 (7-0)</p>
<p>Andrei Pavel (Romania) beat Filip Dewulf (Belgium) 6-1 4-6 2-6</p>
<p>6-2 6-3</p>
<p>UNFINISHED</p>
<p>Michael Stich (Germany) leads Jim Courier (U.S.) 7-6 1-2</p>
<p>Justin Gimelstob (U.S.) leads 11-Gustavo Kuerten (Brazil) 6-3</p>
<p>2-3</p>
<p>Rodolphe Gilbert (France) leads Jeff Tarango (U.S.) 3-6 7-5 2-1</p>
<p>Jerome Golmard (France) leads Jamie Delgado (Britain) 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>6-7 5-2</p>
<p>Luke Milligan (Britain) leads Arnaud Clement (France) 6-2 6-7</p>
<p>4-2</p>
<p>Richey Reneberg (U.S.) leads Hickham Arazi (Morocco) 7-6 0-1</p>
<p>Jiri Novak (Czech Republic) leads Frederik Fetterlein (Denmark)</p>
<p>6-4 6-3 4-5</p>
<p>17-Jonas Bjorkman (Sweden) and Chris Wilkinson (Britain) level</p>
<p>at 6-7 6-0</p>
<p>David Rikl (Czech Republic) leads Daniel Vacek (Czech Republic)</p>
<p>6-1 6-3 2-1</p>
<p>Scott Draper (Australia) leads 15-Wayne Ferreira (South Africa)</p>
<p>7-6 6-3 2-3</p>
<p>Magnus Norman (Sweden) leads Luis Herrera (Mexico) 7-6 3-1</p>
</text>
